          "key1": "mā",
          "key2": "mā́",
          "homograph": null,
          "pageColumn": "804,1",
          "paragraphs": [
            "or with the Pot. (e.g. mā yamam paśyeyam, may I not see Yama; esp. mābhujema in RV.)"
